&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CUSTOM _DEFINITIONS D-Dialog 
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------

  File: 

  Description: from cntnrdlg.w - ADM SmartDialog Template

  Input Parameters:
